repository-code: "https://github.com/NavanithanS/Agent-Skill-Kit"
url: "https://navanithans.github.io/Agent-Skill-Kit/"
abstract: >-
  A command-line package manager for AI agent skills. Define a skill once in a
  standard format and deploy it to Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, Gemini CLI,
  Cursor and Antigravity in each tool's native format, with per-agent format
  adapters, token-budget linting and trigger-collision auditing.
